# m`, payload untyped -- see l2_letter_ns_for). Memoized by payload model
# (0 = the untyped case): a letter's shape is a TYPE, so every receive site
# naming the same payload model, or none, shares one synthesized l2_ns entry --
# not one per site. l2_letter_model_name[k] is 0 for the untyped entry.
int: l2_letter_model_n 0
